We finish our dinner.
Then, we take the empty plates into the kitchen.
Priya says, "Let's drink chai now."
I say, "Yes, and let's eat the Kaju Katli too."
Priya brings a hot cup of chai for me.
She brings a cup for herself too.
Then she opens the box of sweets that I brought.
She gives me a Kaju Katli.
She smiles and says, "I will definitely eat one too."
The sweet is very fresh and delicious.
We sit together and drink chai.
The sweet Kaju Katli and strong chai taste absolutely great.
I am feeling very nice this evening.
I think that I am making good friends here.
Mumbai does not feel unfamiliar to me now.
I think that I am finally creating my friend circle here.
On Monday I will tell Rohan about this at the office.
